# Benchmark run output is a fresh artifact each run, not source. The harness
# (fixtures/, goldens/, src/, tools/, README) IS committed; results are not.
results/*
# Exceptions: the pinned reference points ARE committed so optimization passes
# can diff against them. baseline_v1 = pre-feature v1 starting point;
# post_feature = the frozen feature-complete reference; best = the current
# champion the loop must beat. Only latest.json stays a throwaway per-run artifact.
!results/baseline_v1.json
!results/post_feature.json
!results/best.json
